# Task 8: Retrieval Quality Evaluation and Limitation Analysis

## Ethiopian Legal Semantic Retrieval System

---

# 1. Objective

The objective of this evaluation was to measure the retrieval quality of the Ethiopian Legal Semantic Retrieval System by testing its ability to retrieve the correct constitutional provisions for different types of legal questions.

The evaluation also identifies retrieval limitations, compares different retrieval configurations, and recommends the best setup for the final Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) pipeline.

