# 6. Top-K Evaluation

The final retrieval configuration was tested using different Top-K values.

| Top-K | Hit Rate | Precision@K | MRR | Avg. Relevance |
|------:|----------:|------------:|----:|---------------:|
| Top-1 | 73.3% | 1.00 | 0.73 | 2.9 / 3.0 |
| Top-3 | **93.3%** | **0.88** | **0.74** | **2.8 / 3.0** |
| Top-5 | 100% | 0.65 | 0.74 | 2.4 / 3.0 |

### Analysis

Top-3 provided the best balance between retrieval accuracy and precision while avoiding unnecessary documents in the LLM context window.

